; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M10: ATRentry trailing (TrailMode 1), setup 2 of 4: both, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 200, target 3R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: 1.5 x ATR(14) of M10 at entry behind the best price once the profit reaches 0.5 x ATR, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 1, TrailParam 0).
; Same setup as Loma_T15_Gold_M10_ATRentry_2of4_Both_0700-2000_M30 in Loma_XAUUSD_v1_35.zip (only the magic number differs): run one or the other, not both.
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.39): 186 trades, PF 1.70. Replay of the same months: 178 trades, PF 1.35.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). May 16 - Nov 13 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 56 trades, PF 1.19, net +2.1R (stressed PF 1.03); the 4 setups of M10 + ATRentry together 203 trades, PF 1.57, net +27.9R (stressed 1.38).
; ATRentry was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M10 (highest PF of those with 100+ trades in those months), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: Jul 15 - Dec 31 2024, 60 trades, PF 0.42. The 4 setups together: Jul 15 - Dec 31 2024, 154 trades, PF 0.58. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
